    // After Get(2), order becomes [2, 1] → wait, no: after Get(2), 2 is moved to front, so order is [2, 1]? No, initial order after Put: [2, 1]? Let's clarify:
    // Put(1) → list: [1], Put(2) → list: [2, 1] (2 is front, 1 is back)
    // Get(1) → moves 1 to front → list becomes [1, 2]
